  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 43e02e3c3242c475dbda32cc925fe094, type: 2}
  _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b0efb9ebf8804f39a64eb09f5e67af0, type: 2}
  _lines:
  - Because. I do want you to fail. You leave. I relist. I raise the rent. I get
    a new tenant. They disappoint. They leave. I raise the rent...
  - Why would I invest in a parasite like you? You act as if I invented the roach,
    or left <i>your</i> trash bag at the front door... never swept behind the fridge...
    invited them in.
  - You disgusting... <i>renters</i>. You will never know beauty. How can you, if
    you've never tasted profit?
  - There's one more matter to address.
  _options: []
  _Chat: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e19ac9f3a19f4fc28d2029be8eceda6, type: 2}
